@startuml 03_system_context
title Résumé / myJob Suite — System Context (UML)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
left to right direction

actor "Applicant\n(owner)" as Owner
actor "External app" as Ext

rectangle "Résumé / myJob Suite" as System {
  component "REST API\n/api/v1" as API
  component "Web UIs\n(CV, cover letter, myJob)" as UI
}

node "Headless Chromium\n(Puppeteer)" as Chromium
database "Filesystem\nbewerbungen/" as FS
node "git" as Git

Owner --> UI : uses (browser)
Owner --> API : records / builds applications
Ext --> API : integrates (HTTP/JSON)

API --> Chromium : render HTML -> PDF
API --> FS : read/write store + archived PDFs
API --> Git : version every change

@enduml
